  <caption>Choosing snow boots by how you'll use them</caption>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col">Use</th><th scope="col">Look for</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><th scope="row">Town, travel, and the base area</th><td>Waterproof, moderate insulation, easy on and off, good traction</td></tr>
